<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">YAKOBI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakobi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Pauli kwa Yakobi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yakobi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya Pauli kwa Yakobi</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu sa Yakobi saandikilwe na mundu ywakemelwa Yakobi. Yendawesekana panga ayu' nga Yakobi ywaabile nnunawe Yesu kwa mau' bake na kolongosi wa kanisa lilongoi, yumo ywa alongosi wa balasa li'lu' lilongoi lya kanisa lyalyapangike ku Yelusalemu (Makowe ga Atumilwe 15:13). Kai' Ntumilwe Pauli ankemite kolongosi wa kanisa (Agalatia 2:9). Asomi ba Bibilia bau'bi'lya panga kitabu sa Yakobi saandikilwe kubile balo kunaikali mwaka wa 50 bu'ka po belekwa Yesu Kilisitu. Kwa mwanjaa Yakobi aai kolongosi wa kanisa lyalyabile ku Yelusalemu, yendawesekana panga kitabu so akiandike paabile katama mumuyi wo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yakobi akiandika kitabu sake kaali'nga galu' makabila ku'mi na gabi'li' gagabaganike mudunia (1:1). Mayi'gano gagabile mukitabu sa Yakobi gendapwaika kwa Akilisitu boti, lakini matumyo ga mayi'gi'yo “Makabila ku'mi na gabi'li'” gapanga kube na uwesekano wo panga Yakobi aandike balua yi' kaali'nga Akilisitu bababile ba lubelekwo lwa Kiyahudi. Kwa mwanjaa kitabu si' sabinilwe kwiikya ipi'nga yambone ya asomi, kilongelyage abali mbali'mbali'. Yakobi ali'nga laya mu'lu' mwakulu'mbana kwa imani na iyendo. Imani ya kakape ibonekana muyendo yake. (2:17). Kai' akwi'li'ka bu'kana no tepya kwa bandu bababile matayili, na kutubakia tutame wiso bu'kana na galu' gatulongela.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yakobi aasalimia asomi bake <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:1">1:1</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Asenga Akilisitu bakomeye pabapi'ta mungu'su'mbu' <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:2-27">1:2-27</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Aawanikia mwaipalikwa kwilaya imani kwa ndi'la ya iyendo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 2:1-26">2:1-26</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Kai' aawanikia ndi'la yo panga mayi'gi'yo gakombwe baa na makakala <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Yakobi alaya ikima ya Nnu'ngu' mwaiyelengine na ikima ya padunia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 3:13-4:10">3:13-4:10</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Kai' akwi'li'ka asomi bake kanebaipune <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 4:11-5:6">4:11-5:6</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Yakobi ayomolya kitabu sake kwo awanikia kwa mayumu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 5:7-20">5:7-20</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="s">Salamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Nenga na Yakobi, nantumisi wa Nnu'ngu' na wa Bwana Yesu Kilisitu. Nimwandikyanga mwenga, mwaaumini ba ngolo ku'mi na ibi'li' ya bandu ba Nnu'ngu', mwamubaganike mudunia yoti. Salamu.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imani na ikima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Mwaalongo bangu', pamupata mapayilwo ga sampuli mbali'mbali', mwibalangili panga mwendanapusika muno, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />kwa mwanjaa, mutangite panga payilwa kwa imani yinu kuyongekeya ukomeyi. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Muyendeli komeya mpaka kuundi'la, li'nga mube mwabandu mwamukomile na mwamukamilike, pangali pu'ngu'ki'lwa kili'be sosoti. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Lakini manaitei yumo ywinu apu'ngu'kilwe na ikima na annu'be Nnu'ngu', na ywembe alu'a peyelwa. Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' aapeya bandu boti pangali kalipya na kwa mwoyo nnogau. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Lakini apalikwa alu'be kwa imani, pangali kyukala sosoti. Mwanjaa mundu mwene kyukala, alandana na mabi'mbi' ga baali, gaganokolwa na mbu'nga ku'no na kwo. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7-8" />Kwa nyo, mundu ywai na kyukala, mwene mabinio gabi'li' muiyendo yake yoti, kaneaganiye panga aalu'a pokya kili'be bu'ka kwa Bwana.<verse eid="JAS 1:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uki'ba na utayili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Muumini ywabile nki'ba apalikwa apulaike muno, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' ampangite au'bu'yi'lwe. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Lakini aumini matayili bapalikwa napusika muno palu' pabauluyilwa na Nnu'ngu'. Kwa mwanjaa matayili baalu'a oba kati malu'ba ga mmwitu. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Lisu'ba palibanjwa no balaa muno, lyoto lyake ngaliyu'mi'ya maakapi, na galu' malu'ba gake ngagapolota no obeya ugolou wake. Nyinyonyo na tayili, naywembe aalu'a oba ku'no kayendelya na mengo gake.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapayilwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Nantali mundu ywakomeya nsimu wa mapayilwo, kwa mwanjaa mana ayomwike sinda alyo lipayilwo, aalu'a peyelwa taji ya ukoto wangayomoka, yaalagi Nnu'ngu' kwapeya balu' babampenda. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Mundu papayilwa apalikwali baya, “Nipayilwa na Nnu'ngu'.” Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' awesali payilwa na malau, wala ywembe awesali kumpaya mundu ywoywoti. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Lakini kila mundu apayilwa kwo utilwa no kongelwa na maminyikio gake manyatau. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Bai, ago maminyikio manyatau mana gakomile, gapapa sambi, na ayo sambi mana ikomile ipapa kiwo.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Mwaalongo bangu' mwamupendilwe, kanemukongelwe. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Kila upo inannoga yaikamilike ibu'ka kunani kwa Tati', Nnu'ngu' ywaumbike ili'be yoti yaipiya bweya. Ywembe agalambukali wala yelenganika kati mwakipanga kiwili. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Kwo penda kwake mwene Nnu'ngu', aatupapike twenga kwa liyi'gi'yo lyake lya kakape, li'nga tube kati mili'mbu' muili'be yake yoti yaiumbike.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yu'wa no panga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Mwaalongo bangu' mwamupendilwe, muku'mbu'ki likowe li'! Kila mundu apalikwa abe nnyu'yu'u wo yu'wa, na kwenda wo longela wala usika lili. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Kwa mwanjaa nyongo ya mundu ipangali aki ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Kwa nyo mugabi'ke kuutalu makowe goti maakau na iyendo yoti ndau. Mukamwe liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' lyalibi'kilwe nkati ya myoyo yinu kwo gegekeya, kwa mwanjaa alyo ngaliwesa kunkosopolya. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Kanemwikonge mwabene kwo pi'kania liyi'gi'yo lyake bai, ila mupalikwa mupange galu' gagabayilwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Kwa mwanjaa mundu mana kapikania Liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' bai no kotoka panga si'lu' sakibayilwa, ywembe nga kati mundu ywailingulya kuminyo yake mukilolo. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Endakwilingulya mwene bu'kapo endabu'ka, lakini mana abu'i bai endakwilibalya mu'lu' mwabile. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Lakini mundu ywalingulya kwo binia salya yaikamilike yayaapeya bandu uulu, no yendelya kwikamwa, na kwenda kwo yu'wa baili bu'kapo libalya, ila katimisa galu' gagabayilwa, mundu ywo aayaliwa na Nnu'ngu' kwa kila kikowe sakipanga.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Manaitei mundu kaganiya panga abile nayo dini, lakini kasindwa kuluki'li'bu'ya lulimi lwake longela maakau, aikonga mwene na dini yake ipwaikali kili'be. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Dini yaibile mbeleteu, yangali baa na usapu, yaiyi'ki'ti'lwa na Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu nga yi'no, kwayangatia bana aki'ba na alwawa awi'li'ka muupali woti, na kwiili'ndi'la mwabene na ulau wa dunia yi'.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Likwi'li'ko bu'kana na ubauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Mwaalongo bangu', kwa mwanjaa mumwu'bi'li Yesu Kilisitu, Bwana mwene utukupu, kanemwabawe bandu. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Tubaye mundu yumo ywaayingya pamukongolekana ywaweti lupete lwa zaabu na ngu'bo ya bei ngu'lu', na popopo ngayingya kai' nki'ba mwene buula, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />na mwenga ngamumpeya isima yu'lu' ywaweti magu'bo ga bei ngu'lu' na kummakia, “Utame pandu papapanogelile,” Lakini yu'lu' nki'ba ngamummakia, “Wenga uyi'me palu',” au, “Utame pano papipi panipala bi'ka magu'lu' gangu'.” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Buli awo ubauli lili nkati yinu? Buli, mwibonali panga muamwi maakau?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Mwaalongo bangu', mupi'kani! Buli, Nnu'ngu' aasawili balu' bababile aki'ba padunia no baa matayili muimani no lisi ukulungwa waalagile balu' babampenda? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Lakini mwenga munsalawi yu'lu' nki'ba. Buli, abo matayili ka ngababantotya na kumpeleka mwenga kumankama? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Buli, bembe ka nga balu' babalikupulu lina li'lu' lya Yesu Kilisitu lyalibile lya ngama muno lyamukemilwe nalyo?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Mu Maandiko Mapeleteu, salya ya ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' ibaya panga, <char style="qt">“Umpende ywa papipi yako kati mu'lu' mwawipenda wamwene,”</char> Mana kamupanga nnya, mwendanogeya. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Lakini mana kamwabawa bandu, mupanga sambi, na salya imukumu panga mwenga mwaakosa. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Kwa mwanjaa mundu ywoywoti ywakamwa salya yoti lakini kati'kwana yimo, aywo aapanga kati ati'kwaniye salya yoti. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Kwa mwanjaa yu'lu' ywabaite, <char style="qt">“Kaneupange upege,”</char> nga yu'yu'lu'yu'lu' ywabaite, <char style="qt">“Kaneubulage.”</char> Kwa nyo, ata ikatei upangali upege, lakini kobulaga, wenga upanga uti'kwaniye salya. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Bai, mulongele no panga kati mwabandu mwamwaalu'a ukumilwa kwa salya yi'lu' yaileta uulu. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' alu'a pangali na kiya paalu'a kumukumu mundu ywangali panga kiya. Lakini kiya sa Nnu'ngu' saalu'a kwisinda ukumu.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imani na iyendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Mwaalongo bangu', kubile na pwaila yaku' mundu baya abile na imani, lakini kakotoka laya iyendo? Buli ayo imani yawesa kunkosopolya? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Manaitei nku'wo au nnu'mbu'wo abile na buula au ntu'pu' kilyo, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />na yumo ywinu ngammakia, “Uyende kwa amani, ukayote mwoto no yukuta,” pangali kumpeya si'lu' sapala bu'kana na upali wake, yapanga na pwaila yaku'? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Nyinyonyo na imani kisake pangali iyendo, ilaya mpu'la panga imani yinu iwile.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Lakini mundu awesa baya, “Wenga ubile nayo imani, nenga nibile nayo iyendo!” Aya! Unilaye mundu mwawesa baa na imani pangali iyendo, na nenga nilu'a kulaya imani yangu' kwa ndi'la ya iyendo yangu'. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Buli, wendau'bi'lya panga kubile na Nnu'ngu' yumo? Eloo! Lakini ata masetani gau'bi'lya nyo no lendema kwo yogopa. <figure style="fig" alt="Abraham sacraficing Isaac - LB00291" file="AbrahamSacrificingIsaac_Gen22.9-10_LB00291.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="2:19" /> <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Wenga wannogeloge! Buli upala layilwa panga imani pangali iyendo ipwaikali kili'be? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Buli, Bulaimu tati' bitu baabalangilweli aki kwa kumpiya mwana wabe Isaki panga salaka pakibi'ki'lyo? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Kakape uwesa kwibona imani yo mwaipangite kasi pamope na iyendo yake, kwa nyo imani yake yaatimilike kwa iyendo yake. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Kwa nyo ngagatimya galu' Maandiko Mapeleteu gagabaya, <char style="qt">“Bulaimu aamwu'bi'li Nnu'ngu' ngabalangilwa panga mundu mwene aki nnu'ngi' yake.” Na nyo ngakemelwa mbwigalye Nnu'ngu'.</char> <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Bai, mwibona panga Nnu'ngu' ammalangilya mundu panga mwene aki nnu'ngi' yake bu'kana na iyendo yake, kwenda bu'kana na imani yake bai lili.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Nyinyonyo ata kwa Rahabu, yu'lu' mpege, aabalangilwe aki kwa galu' gaapangite, paapoki balu' apekeseni na kwatoloya kwa kwabakia bali'nge ndi'la yi'ngi'. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Kati mu'lu' mwaibile yi'ga pangali loo iwile, nga nyinyonyo na imani pangali iyendo iwile.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Lulimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Mwaalongo bangu', nkati yinu kanekube na balimu baingi, kwa mwanjaa mutangite panga twenga twabalimu twaalu'a ukumilwa muno kwapi'ta bandu bi'ngi'. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Twenga twaboti twendakosa mumakowe mbali'mbali'. Na manaitei mundu ywoywoti aponanganali muulongeli wake, aywo nga mundu ntimya, kai' awesa kwikanikia yi'ga yake yoti. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Twenga tuyi'ya lijamu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lijamu lilombolya kipande sa kyu'ma sakibi'ki'lwa munkano wa falasi li'nga kunnongoya ywau'bwike ayende kwapala.</char></note> munkano wa falasi, li'nga apange kati mwatupala. Kwa nyo twiilongoya yi'ga yabe yoti yenda pandu popoti patupala. <figure style="fig" alt="Horse and rider reins - LB00035" file="Horse&amp;RiderReins_James3.3_LB00035.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="3:3" /> <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Au mulinguli ngalaba. Pamope no panga nga ngu'lu' muno, nayembe inokolwa na limbu'nga likali', lakini igalambuyilwa na nsukani nsini muno, no pelekelwa popoti papala ywailongoya. <figure style="fig" alt="Ship at sea + rudder - HK00215" file="ShipAtSea+Rudder_HK00215.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="3:4" /> <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Nyinyonyo na lulimi nga kili'mbi'li'mbi' kisene bai muyi'ga, lakini luwesa kwipunia makowe maku'lu' muno.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Muganiye lilimi lya mwoto mwaliwesa tiniya mwitu nku'lu' muno! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Kwa nyo lulimi nga kati mwoto, lutwi'li ulau woti. Lulimi nga kili'mbi'li'mbi' simo bai muili'mbi'li'mbi' yitu ya yi'ga, lakini luwesa bambiya ulau kwa mundu ywoti, no langamisa maisa gake goti kwa mwoto wangayomoka. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Bandu bawesa uga inyama ya sampuli mbali'mbali', iyuni, inyama yaikwaba na yumbe yoti ya mubaali. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Lakini ntu'pu' ywawesike kuluuga lulimi lwake. Lulimi nga kili'be kilau, ulau wangali totokelwa, na lutwi'li sumu yaibulaga. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Tutumya lulimi kwa kunkwi'ya Bwana ywabile Tati' bitu. Lakini kai' tutumya lulimi lwolwolwo kwa ndi'la ya kwalaani bandu babaumbilwe na Nnu'ngu' kwa uyi'me wake. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Milongelo yo yalya no laani ipita munkano gumo. Mwaalongo bangu', ipalikwali panga nya. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Buli, kinywanyu sa pandu pamo kiwesa piya masi' maangalau na matombolou kai'? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Mwaalongo bangu' buli, ntini uwesa pambiya njaituni? Au nnjabibu uwesa pambiya tini? Nyinyonyo, kinywanyu sa masi' matombolou, kiwesali piya masi' maangalau.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikima yaibu'ka kunani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Buli, nga ywaku' mwene ikima na malango nkati yinu? Bai, alaye likowe lyo kwa nnyendo wake unannoga, kwo panga iyendo kwo liya kwakubu'kana na ikima. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Lakini manaitei mumyoyo yinu kutwi'li bwigu nkali' na kwipenda mwabene, kanemwilumbe kwa kitumbu sa ago kwa mwanjaa, kwipuna kwinu kulu'e panga ubu'su' wauiya kweli. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Ikima ya sampuli yo ibu'kali kunani, ila ibu'kana na dunia nayembe nga ya kiyi'ga na ya kisetani. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Mwanjaa popoti papabile na bwigu na kwipenda bene, nga papabile na bulwe na ulau wa kila sampuli. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Lakini ikima yaibu'ka kunani, wi'ti' mbeleteu, bu'kapo ipenda amani kai' yo tu'lya, yaiyi'ki'tya pi'kania bi'ngi' kwo gegeya, yaitwi'li kiya na iyendo inannoga, yangali baa na ubauli wala ubu'su'. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Mauno ga aki gapandilwa muamani na balu' babaleta amani.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Limbwiga na dunia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Maku'mbwano na bulwe waupitya nkati yinu ubu'ka kwaku'? Buli, aga gabu'kanali na maminyikio ginu gagataukana nkati ya yi'ga yinu? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Muminyikia ili'be, na kwa mwanjaa mwiipatali, mwibona ili'ngani ata bulaga. Mubi'ka bwigu lakini mupatali kili'be, kwa nyo mwendayu'mana no ku'mbwana. Mupatali kili'be kwa mwanjaa mukilu'bali kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Pamulu'ba mupatali kwa mwanjaa mulu'ba kwa mabinio maakau, mulu'ba li'nga mupate timisa maminyikio ginu. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Mwenga mwabandu bangali u'bi'li'ka, mutangiteli panga limbwiga na dunia nga undumu kwa Nnu'ngu'? Kwa nyo mundu ywoywoti ywapala panga limbwiga na dunia, aywo apangika nndumu ywa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Kanemuganie panga Maandiko Mapeleteu gaabaite mayi'gi'yo gabule pagaabaite, “Loo ywabi'kilwe na Nnu'ngu' nkati yitu abile na bwigu pi'ta.” <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Lakini ngu'ngu' yatuipata kwa Nnu'ngu' nga ngu'lu' pi'ta, kwa mwanjaa Maandiko Mpeleteu gabaya, <char style="qt">“Nnu'ngu' aataukya babaipuna, lakini apeya ngu'ngu' babagegekeya.”</char><verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Bai, munnyu'we Nnu'ngu', muyi'me kwo kangamala kunkana Ibilisi na ywembe aalu'a kuntila. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Mumwegeleli Nnu'ngu', naywembe alu'a kumwegelelya. Mupeleteye maboko ginu, mwenga mwabene sambi. Mwiipeleteye myoyo yinu mwenga mwamubile na mabinio gabi'li'. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Muusunike, lombola no li'la, eka kwinu kugalambuyilwe kube lombola, no pulaika kwinu kugalambuyilwe kube usunika muno. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Mwiuluye nnu'ngi' ya Bwana, na ywembe aalu'a kuntu'ndu'bi'ya.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likwi'li'ko bu'kana no ukumu bi'ngi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Mwaalongo bangu', kanemubi'kyane lukoolo mwabene na bene. Ywammi'kya lukoolo nnongowe na kumuukumu, aywo aisalawa salya na kwiukumu. Manaitei kawiukumu salya, bai wenga wiyu'wali salya ila wendakwiukumu. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Nnu'ngu' mwene ngaywabi'ka salya, na ngaywawesa ukumu. Ywembe ngaywawesa kosopolya no langamisa. Lakini wenga wanyai ata uwese kumuukumu nnyino?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likwi'li'ko bu'kana na kwipuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Bai, munipi'kani wiso mwenga mwamubaya panga, “Li'no au malau', twaalu'a yabwa mwanja wo yenda kukilambo nsi'si', twaalu'a tama kwo mwaka gumo, katupanga nsuluso witu no pata pwaila.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Mwenga mutangiteli ata maisa ginu mwagaalu'a baa malau'! Maisa ginu ki'li'? Mwenga nga kati luti lwalubonekana kwa wakati nsene bai, bu'kapo lwendaku'ngu'lu'ka. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Paali pake mupalikwa baya, “Mana Bwana apendile, twaalu'a tama kwo no panga li'no na li'lu'.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Lakini nambi'yambi' mwendakwilumba na kwipuna. Kwipuna kwa sampuli yo nga ulau. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Bai, mundu ywoywoti ywatangite manogau gagapalikwa panga, lakini kakotoka panga, aywo ngaywapanga sambi.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Likwi'li'ko bu'kana na matayili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Nambi'yambi' mupi'kani mwenga mwamatayili, muli'le no lombola kwa lilobe liku'lu' kwa kitumbu sa tabu ngu'lu' yailu'a kumwisilya. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Utayili winu uboi na magu'bo ginu baotwaniye ngu'lu'ku'lu'. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Zaabu na mbanje yinu itu'i ngugu, na ngugu yo ilu'a kunkong'ondelya bu'kana na mwenga, nayembe ilu'a lya yi'ga yinu kati mwaibile mwoto. Mwenga mwiikongoli mali mumasu'ba gano ga kuundi'la. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Mupi'kani, apangakasi binu mwabaku'ku'li'ka! Baapangite kasi mumigunda yinu lakini mwaali'piteli. Na babaamuni mauno na bembe bendaku'ku'li'ka, na kili'lo sabe kiyu'wanike mumasikilo ga Bwana Mwene Uweso Woti. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Mutami mudunia no pulaikya maisa ga kitayili. Mwinenepiye kwa kwibi'ka wiso sinjilwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Mutikwaukumu na kwabulaga bandu bene aki, bangali taukana na mwenga.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Komeya no saalya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Kwa nyo mwaalongo bangu', mukomeye mpaka paalu'a buyangana Bwana. Mulinguli, nni'mi mwauli'nda nng'unda wake upiye mauno ga pwaila. Ywembe ali'nda kwo komeya ula wa ntu'lo na kyuku mpaka kuundi'la. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Na mwenga mupalikwa komeya, kai' muyi'me mwakangamala, kwa mwanjaa buya kwa Bwana Yesu kwegelile.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Mwaalongo bangu', kanemuku'ku'li'kyane li'nga mwaakane ukumilwa. Akimu ayi'mi paniango! <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Mwalinguli alondoli babaalondwi kwa lina lya Bwana, li'nga baa lukongo lwo komeya mungu'su'mbu'. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Twaakema abo panga bayaliwite, kwa mwanjaa baatikomeya. Muyu'wine abali yo komeya kwa Ayubu, na mutangite mu'lu' Bwana mwaampangile kuundi'la. Mwanjaa, Bwana atwi'li muno kiya.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Pi'ta pa ago goti, mwaalongo bangu', kanemulape, ipange kunani au pai' au kwa kili'be si'ngi' sosoti. “Eloo” yinu ibe eloo, na “Lili” yinu ibe lili, li'nga mwaakane yingya muukumu ya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Buli, abile mundu pakati yinu ywaku'su'mbu'lwa? Bai, apalikwa alu'be Nnu'ngu'. Au abile mundu ywapulaika? Bai, apalikwa ayi'mbe myambo yo lumba. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Buli, kubile na ntamwe pakati yinu? Apalikwa kwakema api'ndo ba kanisa, na bembe bannu'bi na kumpakaya mauta kwa lina lya Bwana. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Mana kabalu'ba kwa imani, aywo ntamwe aalu'a yu'yu'ki'lwa na ywembe Bwana aalu'a kunkakatuya, na manaitei aapangite sambi, aalu'a samilwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Bai, muyi'ki'ti ungama masambi ginu mwabene na bene no lu'byana kwa Nnu'ngu' li'nga mupate pona. Lu'ba kwa mundu mwene aki kubile na makakala kai' kupanga kasi. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Elia aai mundu kati twenga. Ngalu'ba kwo binia panga ula kaneanie, na ula aanileli munni'ma kwa myaka itatu na myei sita. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Bu'kapo ngannu'ba Nnu'ngu' kai', ula ngania bu'ka kumaunde na nni'ma ngaupiya mauno.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Mwaalongo bangu', yumo ywinu mana aobite no yenda kuutalu na kweli, na ywi'ngi' mundu kunki'li'bu'ya, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />mutange panga, aywo ywanki'li'bu'ya mwene sambi bu'ka mundi'la yake yo oba, aalu'a kwikosopolya loo yake bu'ka mukiwo, na sambi yambone alu'a samilwa.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>